          "mojo_requires": ">=1.0.0",
          "deps": [],
          "changelog": "Strict RFC 8259 parsing, correctly rounded numbers (Eisel-Lemire / Schubfach), \\uXXXX decoding, nesting limit, hash-indexed objects. Breaking: rejects non-RFC input; floats print Python-style (100.0); len(string) counts codepoints."
        },
        {
          "version": "3.0.1",
          "published_at": "2026-10-03",
          "tarball_url": "https://github.com/Mosaad-M/json/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.1.tar.gz",
          "sha256": "e5c215633a2b0ac53d608aeaa5b48e279b7e1c1cb0d19e6eb397de5754666594",
          "mojo_requires": ">=1.0.0",
          "deps": [],
          "changelog": "Flat document layout: parse_json returns a read-only JsonDoc; lookups return JsonRef views (breaking: call to_value() for a mutable JsonValue). Parse up to 3.9x faster, worst-case memory ~8x input (was 85x), no recursion, no hash flooding. (3.0.1: no clock_gettime declaration, fixing a Linux symbol clash with requests 1.1.)"
        }
      ]
    },
